-- a bijection of a finite model commuting with `x □ y = if (M.op a b) = b then (M.op a b) else if (M.op b b) = a then b else (M.op a b)` is an automorphism of `◇` --
is `GuardAut2_pxy_y_pyy_x_pxy_y_pxy_Equation4383`, proved elsewhere.  That obligation names no target, so every
law the companion satisfies is another cell for free, and there
are 3 of them below.
